<title>NETHERLANDS: Royal Dutch interim div 4.30 guilders.</title>
<headline>Royal Dutch interim div 4.30 guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Dutch Petroleum Co said it would pay a 1996 interim dividend of 4.30 guilders per share, versus a 1995 interim payout of 3.90 guilders.</p>
<p>Dutch-based Royal Dutch Petroleum Co owns 60 percent of the Royal Dutch/Shell oil group.</p>
<p>British-based Shell Transport and Trading Plc owns 40 percent of the group.  </p>
<p>The 1996 interim dividend is payable from September 24. Royal Dutch shares will go ex-dividend in Amsterdam and London on September 16.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
